       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CMB4K2.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
       01  WS-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE
           ACCEPT WS-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED
           CALL 'CMH9P3' USING WS-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE
                                WS-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED
                                WS-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION
           DISPLAY WS-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM CMB4K2.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CMH9P3.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE PIC X.
       01  LK-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED PIC X.
       01  LK-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION      PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE
                                LK-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED
                                LK-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION.
       2000-CHECK-ELIGIBILITY.
           IF LK-SATISFACTORY-RESPONSE = 'N' AND
              LK-CALENDAR-MONTH-PASSED = 'Y'
              MOVE 'Y' TO LK-OMBUDSMAN-OPTION
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM CMH9P3.
